      "notes": "Outputs matched by rule name: BOOK, AVAILABILITY_CHECK, MISSING_INFO, UNSUPPORTED, SPECIALIZATION_SEARCH (no doctor picked yet -> treat as MISSING_INFO in practice).",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
